     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b>Von:</b> National Centre for Statistical Ecology Members Mailing List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt; im Auftrag von Eleni Matechou &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">00014031ee1a45e...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Dienstag, 3. November 2026 15:05<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> Leverhulme PhD project to forward to contacts</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nWould it be possible to forward this information to potential PhD students or to keep in mind when advising students looking for PhD projects?</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nCheers!</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nEleni</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:1.3333rem 0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b>Living with gulls: modelling how our waste shapes the lives of gulls and people</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:1.3333rem 0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThis is a four-year, fully funded Leverhulme <i>Living with Waste</i> scholarship, with a substantial conference and travel budget. The student will join a cohort of doctoral researchers and receive broad interdisciplinary training. </div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:1.3333rem 0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe project will develop spatio-temporal statistical models for multi-source data to understand how waste shapes where gulls live and which communities live with them. The models will be used to quantify how landfill operations and urban food waste have shifted\r\n gulls between coast, landfill and town; identify which communities live with gulls, and how this relates to deprivation, housing and waste services; and assess whether changes to waste management could reduce human-gull conflict without displacing it or harming\r\n gull populations. Gulls cost councils substantial sums, are in decline, and the impacts of their urban presence fall unevenly. How waste drives these three dynamics is poorly understood. </div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:1.3333rem 0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe student will gain skills in statistical modelling, data integration and machine learning, valued in academia, government and industry, and apply them to a growing question: how decisions about waste change the way people and wildlife share space. The interdisciplinary\r\n training offered through the Living with Waste school, and co-supervision by human and cultural geographers, will equip the student with qualitative skills and the ability to situate the research within social scientific, political and humanist debates on\r\n human-nonhuman relations in urban contexts. </div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:1.3333rem 0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nInformation about the project <a href=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/projects-and-supervisors/2026-4-year-call/living-with-gulls/\" title=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/projects-and-supervisors/2026-4-year-call/living-with-gulls/\" style=\"margin:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/projects-and-supervisors/2026-4-year-call/living-with-gulls/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793865659947000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZylZYYUWsYDw-NQ6a5Erb\">\r\nhttps://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/projects-and-supervisors/2026-4-year-call/living-with-gulls/</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nInformation about the <i>Living with Waste</i> Leverhulme Doctoral Programme</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/\" title=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/\" style=\"margin:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793865659947000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3XOUtA_ixnl306_E39Nl3K\">https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nInformation about how to apply <a href=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/how-to-apply/\" title=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/how-to-apply/\" style=\"margin:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/how-to-apply/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793865659947000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jtUi0JtkC0dceIKfnl5bF\">\r\nhttps://www.qmul.ac.uk/about/hss/research/postgraduate-research-student-funding-opportunities/leverhulme-living-with-waste-doctoral-programme/how-to-apply/</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nPlease forward this information to potential applicants and ask them to contact me (Dr Eleni Matechou <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">e.mat...@qmul.ac.uk</a>) if they would like to find out more about the project or the doctoral programme.</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:1.3333rem 0px;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">\r\n<b>Eleni Matechou</b> (she/her)</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">Reader in Statistics</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">School of Mathematical Sciences</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">Queen Mary University of London</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(18,49,129)\">Email: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">e.mat...@qmul.ac.uk</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(36,36,36)\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(31,56,100)\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin:0cm\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(32,31,30)\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\"><a href=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/\" title=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/\" style=\"color:black;margin:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.qmul.ac.uk/&amp;source=gma